/P 40 0 R
/T (3. Lunar Cycle - 1 star per card A Lunar Cycle occurs when 3 or more cards are connected in the same order as the actual phases of the moon. For reference, the moon's phases are on the back of all cards. You can start from any phase of the cycle. 1 star is awarded for every moon phase card in the Lunar Cycle. Lunar Cycles are different than other combinations in that other players can add to them. Every time a player adds on to an exisiting Lunar Cycle, they get as many stars as cards in the cycle. )
/E (3. Lunar Cycle - 1 star per card A Lunar Cycle occurs when 3 or more cards are connected in the same order as the actual phases of the moon. For reference, the moon's phases are on the back of all cards. You can start from any phase of the cycle. 1 star is awarded for every moon phase card in the Lunar Cycle. Lunar Cycles are different than other combinations in that other players can add to them. Every time a player adds on to an exisiting Lunar Cycle, they get as many stars as cards in the cycle. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
