/Title (2. Full Moon Pair - 2 stars Full Moon Pairs occur when two connected cards add up to a full moon. The phases must be on the correct side, i.e., a waning gibbous cannot be paired with a waning crescent.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 804 0 R
/Prev 1482 0 R
/Next 1549 0 R
>>
endobj
1524 0 obj
<<
/Title (Scoring Multiple Combinations When scoring, there might be multiple Phase Pairs, Full Moon Pairs, and Lunar Cycles connected to the card you just laid. All of these are worth stars and need to be scored. As you can imagine, this can be harder to track on more complex boards, so pay attention!)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 804 0 R
/Prev 1550 0 R
/Next 1483 0 R
>>
